  title: The Price of a Name
  content: 'The informant finally agrees to listen, but not to speak for free. Fear,
    greed, and self-preservation all weigh against you, and one wrong move will make
    them shut down. You only need one thing: the name of the person who now possesses
    the figurine of the ancient god.'
